    "cve_id": "CVE-2026-105192",
    "prompt": "\n      请根据以下漏洞信息、搜索结果和漏洞利用代码，生成一份详细的漏洞分析报告，包含有效性分析、投毒风险分析、利用方式、代码分析等内容。请注意以下几点：\n\n    **信息来源：**\n\n    *   **漏洞库信息：**\n        ```\n        {\"cve_id\": \"CVE-2026-105192\", \"sources\": [\"NVD\", \"OSCS\"], \"descriptions\": [\"LMCache multiprocess mode, also called distributed mode, opens an unauthenticated ZeroMQ ROUTER so worker processes can register and share KV cache blocks. Messages on that socket are msgpack. Extension code 1 is passed to DeviceIPCWrapper.Deserialize, which calls pickle.loads, while the server is still decoding request arguments and before the handler runs. A single unauthenticated ZMQ DEALER message to the transport port (default 5555) therefore executes code as the user the LMCache process runs as. Official container images run that process as root. The transport binds to localhost unless the operator sets a routable address with --host, which is how multi-node deployments let peers connect. The decode path shipped in v0.3.9 and is present through v0.5.5, including the v0.5.6 release candidates. v0.5.6, published on 2026-10-14, removes pickle.loads from this path.\", \"\\u6807\\u9898: LMCache\\u53cd\\u5e8f\\u5217\\u5316\\u6f0f\\u6d1e\"], \"published_date\": \"2026-10-07T10:17:32.647\", \"last_modified_date\": \"2026-10-29T11:17:24.523\", \"cvss_score\": 9.8, \"severity\": \"CRITICAL\", \"references\": [\"h\", \"t\", \"t\", \"p\", \"s\", \":\", \"/\", \"/\", \"b\", \"l\", \"o\", \"g\", \".\", \"l\", \"m\", \"c\", \"a\", \"c\", \"h\", \"e\", \".\", \"a\", \"i\", \"/\", \"e\", \"n\", \"/\", \"2\", \"0\", \"2\", \"6\", \"/\", \"1\", \"0\", \"/\", \"1\", \"3\", \"/\", \"a\", \"n\", \"-\", \"u\", \"p\", \"d\", \"a\", \"t\", \"e\", \"-\", \"o\", \"n\", \"-\", \"c\", \"v\", \"e\", \"-\", \"2\", \"0\", \"2\", \"6\", \"-\", \"1\", \"0\", \"5\", \"1\", \"9\", \"2\", \"/\", \"h\", \"t\", \"t\", \"p\", \"s\", \":\", \"/\", \"/\", \"g\", \"i\", \"t\", \"h\", \"u\", \"b\", \".\", \"c\", \"o\", \"m\", \"/\", \"L\", \"M\", \"C\", \"a\", \