    "prompt": "\n      请根据以下漏洞信息、搜索结果和漏洞利用代码，生成一份详细的漏洞分析报告，包含有效性分析、投毒风险分析、利用方式、代码分析等内容。请注意以下几点：\n\n    **信息来源：**\n\n    *   **漏洞库信息：**\n        ```\n        {\"cve_id\": \"CVE-2026-111497\", \"sources\": [\"NVD\", \"CISA\", \"OSCS\"], \"descriptions\": [\"A buffer overflow vulnerability in the Brotli decoder (c/dec/decode.c) in Google Brotli versions 1.0.3 through 1.2.0 on all platforms allows a remote unauthenticated attacker to corrupt adjacent decoder state memory, disclose sensitive memory contents, cause a denial of service, or potentially execute arbitrary code using a crafted Brotli-compressed stream.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nUsers need to update any Brotli libraries or binaries between 1.0.3 through 1.2.0 to the latest available version: 1.0.10 or 1.1.1 or 1.2.1.\", \"\\u6807\\u9898: Node.js Brotli\\u89e3\\u7801\\u8fdc\\u7a0b\\u4ee3\\u7801\\u6267\\u884c\\u6f0f\\u6d1e\"], \"published_date\": \"2026-10-22T14:17:37.190\", \"last_modified_date\": \"2026-10-30T20:30:11.670\", \"cvss_score\": 9.8, \"severity\": \"CRITICAL\", \"references\": [\"h\", \"t\", \"t\", \"p\", \"s\", \":\", \"/\", \"/\", \"g\", \"i\", \"t\", \"h\", \"u\", \"b\", \".\", \"c\", \"o\", \"m\", \"/\", \"a\", \"n\", \"d\", \"y\", \"b\", \"a\", \"l\", \"h\", \"o\", \"l\", \"m\", \"/\", \"b\", \"r\", \"o\", \"t\", \"l\", \"i\", \"/\", \"r\", \"e\", \"l\", \"e\", \"a\", \"s\", \"e\", \"s\", \"/\", \"t\", \"a\", \"g\", \"/\", \"v\", \"1\", \".\", \"2\", \".\", \"7\", \"h\", \"t\", \"t\", \"p\", \"s\", \":\", \"/\", \"/\", \"n\", \"o\", \"d\", \"e\", \"j\", \"s\", \".\", \"o\", \"r\", \"g\", \"/\", \"e\", \"n\", \"/\", \"b\", \"l\", \"o\", \"g\", \"/\", \"v\", \"u\", \"l\", \"n\", \"e\", \"r\", \"a\", \"b\", \"i\", \"l\", \"i\", \"t\", \"y\", \"/\", \"o\", \"c\", \"t\", \"o\", \"b\", \"e\", \"r\", \"-\", \"2\", \"0\", \"2\", \"6\", \"-\", \"s\", \"e\", \"c\", \"u\", \"r\", \"i\", \"t\", \"y\", \"-\", \"r\", \"e\", \"l\", \"e\", \"a\", \"s\", \"e\", \"s\", \"#\", \"n\", \"o\", \"d\", \"e\", \"j\", \"s\", \"-